Sklyanin's page used to be "The Bomb", but he hasn't updated it since
June.

Tonight Rob Speer and I kicked around some html, and we ended up with the
beginning of a Lojban Portal. It will contain links to much (not all)
Lojban stuff. And it will be updated roughly bi-weekly; whenever something
occurs worth noting. Friends of Lojban will be able to monitor the life
and progress of the community without swimming through the mailing list
messages.

http://www.sixgirls.org/xod/lojban/

I surely intend to fill in the link categories on the left, and probably
alter the headings as well.

If Robin Powell wants to use this as the front page of lojban.org, that's
fine. If he doesn't, that's fine too. Two portals are not worse than one!




